    "summary": "Players alternate deployment, beginning with the Defender. Put one eligible unit entirely inside its own deployment zone per placement. Units held in **[strategic reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves)** stay aside. Setting up a **TITANIC** unit costs your next placement opportunity. Once one side finishes, its opponent deploys any remaining units due on the battlefield.",
